        },
        {
          "narration": "Millions of families simply had no bank nearby.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "ui",
            "variant": "list",
            "app": "Field survey \u00b7 2008",
            "lines": [
              "Nearest bank: 40 km away",
              "Transfer fee: up to 10% of the amount",
              "Savings kept under the mattress"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "title": "The challenges",
      "beats": [
        {
          "narration": "Agents need cash on hand, fraud is real, and fees still bite for the poorest users.",
